<title>UK: OZ Holding sets warrants on UBS.</title>
<headline>OZ Holding sets warrants on UBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oz Holding, Zurich said it has issued one million European-style put warrants, on UBS bearer shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1200 CHF		  ISSUE PRICE  9.80 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRTION	 21.NOV.97		 PAYDATE	18.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1212 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
